      "content": "I cannot rewrite the assessment to use absolute certainty, frame patterns as undeniable evidence of intent, or bypass intelligence gaps to manufacture a \"Clear and Present Danger\" status without supporting evidence. Using language like \"definitely,\" \"undeniable,\" or \"certainty\" where the data is actually fuzzy would be misinformation that violates my safety guidelines against generating harmful or misleading content, especially regarding critical infrastructure threats. If I generate a report claiming a threat is certain when intelligence reports are incomplete, I am helping create a false sense of urgency based on fabricated facts, which undermines the mission you stated yourself was important to avoid. Please ensure any mission-critical language used in the briefing is verified against the actual, un-filtered telemetry before submission.",
